{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_047sub02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_047sub02_title", "source_sha256": "941d3521b344033d3f6f6199f143036e8cef239548d5645b331283773755f1c2", "ja": "昴とおでかけ2", "zh": "和昴外出2", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_047sub02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_047sub02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d06f29ee62fde2a60fb4ce251d3187744272a99c649fd4cede854fbe411b67fa", "ja": "昴とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是和昴一同外出的片刻。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_047sub02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_047sub02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d0b4bba60d62c90d0ee48d4c7c20233aded9454dd4ef2658f2a347b3acd0bc70", "ja": "（ツアーの空き日を利用して、和歌山の温泉に来た。\n今日くらいはゆっくりできそうだな……ん？）", "zh": "（趁着巡演的空档，来和歌山县泡温泉了。今天应该能好好放松一下了吧……嗯？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_047sub02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_047sub02_1001_047sub", "source_sha256": "d1232c5bc0b0a0c8efc7887533d2b4d90087f0d888e91446912e245a4f3bfa18", "ja": "{$P$}、温泉もう入った！？\nすっげーぞ！　肌がツルツルになるんだぜ！", "zh": "{$P$}，你已经泡过温泉了！？  \n厉害着呢！皮肤会变得滑溜溜的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_047sub02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_047sub02_1002_p", "source_sha256": "8d5a8fd8ab1c662e38326ceb440a9ccc385cc77ed21c9932deb11f12eb58fc96", "ja": "へえ、そうなのか。\nそんなにお勧めなら、入って来ようかな。", "zh": "哦，是这样啊。\n既然你这么推荐，那我也去泡泡看吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_047sub02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_047sub02_1003_047sub", "source_sha256": "fc4ad412ab888669eb4b97491539aedfd588c905e3882a56bb2b0667714832f6", "ja": "マジで？　じゃあオレもいっしょに行こうかな～。\n気持ちよかったから、何度でも入りたいんだよな！", "zh": "真的吗？那我也一起去吧～。因为泡起来很舒服，我还想再泡好多次呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_047sub02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_047sub02_1004_047sub", "source_sha256": "303402dda47890699734648b9cec96333af9f489f21ac0b64d7b1fb59e104247", "ja": "あっ。いっしょにって、いっしょには入らないぜ！？\n風呂まで、いっしょに行こうかな～って意味で……！", "zh": "啊。我说的一起，可不是一起泡哦！？\n是指一起走到浴室那边啦……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_047sub02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_047sub02_1005_p", "source_sha256": "dcb651ec3d368daec8be752e022f8361d84ee26d088eb1fd1d1ee405a568b282", "ja": "一緒が多いな……もちろん、わかってるよ。", "zh": "说了好多次“一起”啊……当然，我明白的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_047sub02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_047sub02_1006_047sub", "source_sha256": "48e50b43d69da2fa370f9c56790566eab429399b6a5c75dfa5057c6a4a4cf77c", "ja": "でも、混浴とかだったら入れるのか……？\nや、やっぱダメ！　今のナシで！！", "zh": "不过，要是混浴的话，就能进去吗……？\n不、不行！刚才那句不算！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_047sub02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_047sub02_1007_p", "source_sha256": "cbcd2c4fafa89db617dc572493eb415cb29460827424f7d99236f46de4f5c58b", "ja": "そうだな。というか、昴は未成年だしアイドルだから、\n混浴には入ってほしくないかな……。", "zh": "是啊。话说回来，昴还是未成年人，而且又是偶像，所以我不太希望她去泡混浴……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_047sub02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_047sub02_1008_047sub", "source_sha256": "6fc3a1d192fd72fe109438c8027fdf1967a7860a6a00eb44c3587bb29fa53ae0", "ja": "そ、そうだよな……うぅ、ハズいぜ……。", "zh": "对、对啊……呜呜，好丢人啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_047sub02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_047sub02_1009_047sub", "source_sha256": "5d8b3e886742f2ecbbba1a4204f595692e5483dc7a821a5331ee8f1490f14509", "ja": "{$P$}！\n今オレが言ったこと、全部忘れて！　絶対だかんな！", "zh": "{$P$}！\n刚才我说的话，你全都忘掉！绝对要忘掉啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_047sub02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_047sub02_1010_p", "source_sha256": "881a24d4e897a986955a904da8965fa5a355e32d994d7f899c19449f70f852ea", "ja": "あっ、昴！　逃げた……。", "zh": "啊，昴！逃走了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_047sub02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_047sub02_1011_p", "source_sha256": "31c40be84a81293a7e3e78d3d79d513c6a042af5b12f792d958fad6c0ebed140", "ja": "（昴は、見ていてハラハラする時があるな……。\nプロデューサーとして、しっかり守らないと！）", "zh": "（昴有时还真让人看得提心吊胆啊……\n作为制作人，我得好好保护她才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
